{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32063","headline":"欲游嵩岳留别李少尹益 · 贾岛","name":"欲游嵩岳留别李少尹益","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"孤策迟回洛水湄，孤禽嘹唳幸人知。\n嵩岳望中常待我，河梁欲上未题诗。\n新秋爱月愁多雨，古观逢仙看尽棋。\n微眇此来将敢问，凤凰何日定归池。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贾岛","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32063.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32063","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}